WEBVTT

00:01.137 --> 00:02.797
<b>[insects trilling]</b>

00:10.137 --> 00:12.057
<b>[wind howling]</b>

00:12.557 --> 00:14.357
<b>[rustling]</b>

00:16.897 --> 00:18.567
<b>[snores]</b>

00:29.497 --> 00:31.417
<b>[ERIS] When I turned 15,</b>

00:31.457 --> 00:33.837
<b>I got Rudeus
as a birthday present.</b>

00:34.707 --> 00:37.417
<b>It wasn't quite like
we had imagined,</b>

00:37.457 --> 00:39.627
<b>but we belong to each other now.</b>

00:41.637 --> 00:42.967
<b>He's so small.</b>

00:46.217 --> 00:47.767
<b>And yet,</b>

00:47.977 --> 00:50.177
<b>I rely on him for everything.</b>

00:52.137 --> 00:53.477
<b>That's not fair.</b>

00:53.977 --> 00:55.687
<b>I don't deserve him.</b>

00:57.987 --> 00:59.737
<b>[clattering]</b>

01:06.987 --> 01:08.367
<b>[Rudeus moans]</b>

01:08.407 --> 01:11.917
<b>[chuckles] Eris, no. [laughs]</b>

01:13.577 --> 01:14.917
<b>[Rudeus mumbles]</b>

01:14.957 --> 01:16.207
<b>[sword clangs]</b>

01:22.007 --> 01:23.177
<b>[sword slashes]</b>

01:23.217 --> 01:25.717
<b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b>

02:28.987 --> 02:31.947
<b>[TIMOTHY] Is that... Ghislaine?</b>

02:32.787 --> 02:34.367
<b>All right, enough!</b>

02:34.407 --> 02:36.287
<b>Inside! Get a move on!</b>

02:49.757 --> 02:51.427
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

02:51.467 --> 02:53.847
<b>-[wind howling]
-[footsteps]</b>

02:55.937 --> 02:58.437
<b>[yawns]</b>

03:07.527 --> 03:10.487
<b>Well, if it isn't Ghislaine.
Still alive and kicking!</b>

03:10.527 --> 03:12.827
<b>Good to see you again, Master.</b>

03:13.577 --> 03:15.747
<b>I figured you would be
dead in a ditch,</b>

03:15.787 --> 03:18.417
<b>but you don't look half bad.</b>

03:19.127 --> 03:20.747
<b>Now then, who's the little one?</b>

03:20.787 --> 03:23.167
<b>This is my student, Eris.</b>

03:23.207 --> 03:26.087
<b>I brought her because
I want her to learn under you.</b>

03:26.127 --> 03:27.797
<b>[GAL] Really?</b>

03:28.137 --> 03:29.427
<b>Her?</b>

03:31.467 --> 03:34.097
<b>Don't give me that look,
you small fry!</b>

03:36.347 --> 03:39.057
<b>Hey, mind your tongue!
Respect the master!</b>

03:39.097 --> 03:41.727
<b>You're in the presence
of the Sword God Gal Farion,</b>

03:41.767 --> 03:43.017
<b>behave accordingly!</b>

03:43.067 --> 03:44.817
<b>Whatever Ghislaine
has been teaching you,</b>

03:44.857 --> 03:47.397
<b>it certainly hasn't stuck!
Apologize!</b>

03:47.447 --> 03:49.777
<b>[sword saints clamoring]</b>

03:49.817 --> 03:51.987
<b>-Get 'em outta here!
-[GAL] Enough!</b>

03:52.027 --> 03:53.367
<b>[all gasp]</b>

03:53.407 --> 03:55.537
<b>I like that look in your eyes.</b>

03:55.997 --> 03:58.117
<b>Who's the unlucky fool
you're out to kill?</b>

03:58.167 --> 04:01.627
<b>The Dragon God.
Dragon God Orsted!</b>

04:02.327 --> 04:03.707
<b>[FEMALE SAINT] The Dragon God?</b>

04:03.747 --> 04:05.707
<b>[SAINT 1] She's after one
of the Seven Great Powers?</b>

04:05.757 --> 04:07.797
<b>[SAINT 2] Hardly anyone knows
the Dragon God's real name.</b>

04:07.837 --> 04:09.837
<b>-[Gal laughs]
-[BOTH] Hmm?</b>

04:11.177 --> 04:12.547
<b>Well, yeah? Compared to Orsted</b>

04:12.597 --> 04:14.887
<b>I guess I am a small fry,
aren't I, kid?</b>

04:14.927 --> 04:17.597
<b>Good grief, didn't expect
to hear that name.</b>

04:18.597 --> 04:19.847
<b>Guess I'm not surprised</b>

04:19.887 --> 04:22.017
<b>that someone else wants
his blood, besides me.</b>

04:22.057 --> 04:24.477
<b>[laughing]</b>

04:27.647 --> 04:30.527
<b>Of course, anyone can talk
a big game.</b>

04:30.987 --> 04:33.027
<b>You think you have
what it takes?</b>

04:33.067 --> 04:34.237
<b>I know it.</b>

04:39.957 --> 04:41.127
<b>[Gal chuckles]</b>

04:41.957 --> 04:43.377
<b>Let's see it then.</b>

04:43.417 --> 04:45.627
<b>-Gino, take her on.
-[overlapping chatter]</b>

04:45.667 --> 04:47.207
<b>[GINO] Me? Uh, sir!</b>

04:47.667 --> 04:49.507
<b>[GAL] He's the youngest
we've got.</b>

04:49.967 --> 04:52.967
<b>Still kinda wet behind the ears,
but he knows his stuff.</b>

04:58.847 --> 05:00.097
<b>Now face each oth-- Ah!</b>

05:00.767 --> 05:01.977
<b>[GINO] Huh?</b>

05:04.977 --> 05:06.227
<b>[Gino gasps]</b>

05:06.687 --> 05:07.857
<b>[groans]</b>

05:09.817 --> 05:11.857
<b>[thuds]</b>

05:17.237 --> 05:19.197
<b>[GAL] See that?
What did I tell you?</b>

05:19.947 --> 05:21.457
<b>[ERIS] I expected more.</b>

05:21.497 --> 05:22.707
<b>[all gasp]</b>

05:22.747 --> 05:25.417
<b>[GAL] Okay. Nina! You're up.</b>

05:25.457 --> 05:26.747
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

05:26.797 --> 05:29.007
<b>This time,
wait to face off first.</b>

05:29.047 --> 05:30.967
<b>Nothing wrong
with a surprise attack,</b>

05:31.007 --> 05:34.137
<b>but let's see what you can do
after the signal.</b>

05:34.177 --> 05:35.637
<b>[Nina gasps]</b>

05:38.467 --> 05:39.637
<b>[Nina gasps]</b>

05:39.927 --> 05:41.137
<b>[NINA] Hm.</b>

05:48.857 --> 05:49.817
<b>You're dead.</b>

05:49.857 --> 05:51.027
<b>[Eris grunts]</b>

05:51.607 --> 05:52.647
<b>Begin!</b>

05:54.197 --> 05:55.447
<b>[Eris grunts]</b>

05:59.697 --> 06:00.867
<b>[Nina smirks]</b>

06:01.157 --> 06:02.287
<b>[grunting]</b>

06:11.297 --> 06:13.877
<b>-[punches continue]
-[Nina grunting]</b>

06:16.797 --> 06:17.967
<b>All right, that's enough!</b>

06:18.507 --> 06:19.637
<b>Stop!</b>

06:24.387 --> 06:25.477
<b>[gasps]</b>

06:25.517 --> 06:27.557
<b>[Nina whimpering]</b>

06:36.447 --> 06:37.697
<b>[Eris scoffs]</b>

06:38.277 --> 06:40.827
<b>Is everyone
at your stupid school this soft?</b>

06:40.867 --> 06:42.447
<b>[SWORD SAINT] How dare you!</b>

06:42.497 --> 06:43.907
<b>[saints clamoring]</b>

06:45.957 --> 06:49.497
<b>[GAL] Sorry about that!
Looks like I underestimated you.</b>

06:51.257 --> 06:53.087
<b>How about I take you on?</b>

06:53.127 --> 06:55.177
<b>You needn't trouble yourself,
Master.</b>

06:55.217 --> 06:56.217
<b>Please allow me.</b>

06:57.677 --> 06:58.927
<b>[Eris gasps]</b>

07:02.677 --> 07:03.927
<b>[GAL] It's all right!</b>

07:03.967 --> 07:06.187
<b>I don't plan to come at you
at full strength.</b>

07:06.227 --> 07:08.767
<b>That's a pretty beautiful sword
you've got there.</b>

07:08.807 --> 07:11.017
<b>Could that be
the great Julian's work?</b>

07:11.067 --> 07:12.147
<b>[ERIS] Don't ask me.</b>

07:12.187 --> 07:14.147
<b>I got it from the Migurd.</b>

07:14.527 --> 07:15.987
<b>That so?</b>

07:16.777 --> 07:18.657
<b>[sword unsheathes]</b>

07:18.697 --> 07:19.817
<b>[Eris gasps]</b>

07:22.617 --> 07:24.997
<b>[GAL] I've got another Julian
right here.</b>

07:25.037 --> 07:26.577
<b>[Eris grunts softly]</b>

07:30.207 --> 07:32.047
<b>[Eris breathes uneasily]</b>

07:37.467 --> 07:39.177
<b>-You ready?
-[gasps]</b>

07:40.677 --> 07:44.007
<b>[Eris yelling]</b>

07:58.947 --> 08:00.447
<b>-[BOTH] Outstanding!
-Magnificently struck!</b>

08:00.487 --> 08:01.527
<b>[GHISLAINE] Eris!</b>

08:04.157 --> 08:05.487
<b>Eris.</b>

08:10.667 --> 08:12.167
<b>[GAL] Hmm...</b>

08:12.957 --> 08:15.587
<b>[Eris groans]</b>

08:16.667 --> 08:17.917
<b>[Ghislaine sighs]</b>

08:17.967 --> 08:20.427
<b>Ghislaine, patch her up inside.</b>

08:22.257 --> 08:24.597
<b>As of today,
she's a Sword Saint.</b>

08:24.637 --> 08:27.477
<b>Starting tomorrow,
she studies here.</b>

08:27.517 --> 08:29.887
<b>[all murmuring]</b>

08:29.937 --> 08:31.267
<b>[SWORD SAINT] Master!</b>

08:31.307 --> 08:33.307
<b>The title of Sword Saint
is reserved</b>

08:33.357 --> 08:34.687
<b>for those in control
of their aura</b>

08:34.727 --> 08:36.107
<b>who have mastered
the Blade of Light!</b>

08:36.147 --> 08:38.567
<b>That boorish brat has no right
to join our ranks.</b>

08:38.607 --> 08:39.647
<b>Uh?</b>

08:39.697 --> 08:41.567
<b>And yet she handily defeated</b>

08:41.607 --> 08:43.617
<b>two of your peers
without either.</b>

08:43.657 --> 08:44.907
<b>Good enough for me.</b>

08:44.947 --> 08:46.197
<b>[SWORD SAINT] Yes, but--</b>

08:46.237 --> 08:47.697
<b>You learned a trick.</b>

08:47.907 --> 08:51.377
<b>But tradition does not make you
worthy of becoming a Sword God.</b>

08:51.417 --> 08:54.917
<b>I get no special treatment,
and I am special.</b>

08:54.957 --> 08:57.297
<b>Do not assume "fairness"
among Sword Saints</b>

08:57.337 --> 08:58.547
<b>means anything to me.</b>

08:58.587 --> 09:00.417
<b>[sword saint breathes shakily]</b>

09:00.837 --> 09:03.427
<b>[SWORD SAINT]
Of course, Master, my apologies.</b>

09:03.467 --> 09:06.137
<b>[sighs, thuds]</b>

09:06.177 --> 09:07.517
<b>[Eris groans]</b>

09:08.177 --> 09:09.767
<b>[pants]</b>

09:12.727 --> 09:14.057
<b>♪</b>

09:15.807 --> 09:17.527
<b>[sticks clacking]</b>

09:28.997 --> 09:30.497
<b>Is that all you've got?</b>

09:30.537 --> 09:31.617
<b>[Eris grunts]</b>

09:40.917 --> 09:42.127
<b>[Eris yelling]</b>

09:42.167 --> 09:43.547
<b>Come on, now,
you're in a fight.</b>

09:43.587 --> 09:46.047
<b>You don't have time
to think about anything else!</b>

09:46.297 --> 09:47.347
<b>[Eris gasps]</b>

09:48.097 --> 09:49.267
<b>[grunts]</b>

09:50.347 --> 09:51.927
<b>[pants]</b>

09:53.977 --> 09:55.977
<b>[GAL] Empty your mind
and swing your sword.</b>

09:56.357 --> 09:58.067
<b>That's all you need
to focus on,</b>

09:58.107 --> 10:00.687
<b>and when you get tired,
then you can sit and think.</b>

10:00.737 --> 10:02.487
<b>And when you get tired
of thinking,</b>

10:02.527 --> 10:05.237
<b>pick that sword back up
and keep swinging.</b>

10:08.027 --> 10:09.367
<b>[Eris grunts]</b>

10:10.947 --> 10:13.247
<b>[GINO] What?
Ghislaine doesn't really know</b>

10:13.287 --> 10:14.417
<b>how to write, does she?</b>

10:14.457 --> 10:16.127
<b>[FEMALE SWORD SAINT]
She says so.</b>

10:16.167 --> 10:18.087
<b>I don't know anyone
who can read, though,</b>

10:18.127 --> 10:19.877
<b>so it's not like we can check.</b>

10:19.917 --> 10:21.377
<b>[MALE SWORD SAINT]
Yeah, she's probably lying.</b>

10:21.417 --> 10:24.127
<b>Why would Dad
bother to train her?</b>

10:26.087 --> 10:27.387
<b>Give it up already!</b>

10:27.547 --> 10:30.387
<b>You've got more talent
for brawling than swordsmanship!</b>

10:30.427 --> 10:32.057
<b>-[laughter]
-I know, right?</b>

10:32.387 --> 10:33.427
<b>[Eris grunts]</b>

10:33.477 --> 10:34.677
<b>[Nina grunts]</b>

10:34.727 --> 10:36.897
<b>Don't just stand there, Gino,
say something!</b>

10:36.937 --> 10:37.977
<b>[GINO] Um...</b>

10:38.227 --> 10:39.437
<b>[Gino sighs]</b>

10:39.477 --> 10:41.187
<b>Eris, you don't have
to train alone.</b>

10:41.227 --> 10:43.987
<b>You can come join our group
if you want a change of pace.</b>

10:44.027 --> 10:45.857
<b>What? Don't be nice to her!</b>

10:45.897 --> 10:48.277
<b>She's the only one
who gets to train directly</b>

10:48.327 --> 10:51.027
<b>under my father!
Doesn't that drive you crazy?</b>

10:51.077 --> 10:53.537
<b>[GINO] Not really.
She did wipe the floor with me.</b>

10:53.577 --> 10:54.787
<b>[NINA] That's 'cause
the way she fights</b>

10:54.827 --> 10:57.127
<b>is totally beneath
the Sword God Style!</b>

10:57.167 --> 10:59.707
<b>You'd be more than a match
for her in a fair fight!</b>

10:59.747 --> 11:00.877
<b>[GINO] I don't know.</b>

11:01.207 --> 11:02.297
<b>[grunts]</b>

11:02.337 --> 11:03.837
<b>[wind howling]</b>

11:08.677 --> 11:10.257
<b>♪</b>

11:13.387 --> 11:14.767
<b>[Eris inhales deeply]</b>

11:17.647 --> 11:20.937
<b>Something about this
is tougher than I'd thought.</b>

11:23.987 --> 11:25.237
<b>[sighs]</b>

11:28.947 --> 11:30.777
<b>[ERIS] Ghislaine is faster.</b>

11:31.077 --> 11:33.037
<b>Ruijerd is faster.</b>

11:33.577 --> 11:35.537
<b>The Sword God is faster.</b>

11:35.577 --> 11:38.917
<b>And Orsted is way, way faster!</b>

11:40.537 --> 11:42.747
<b>Why am I so slow?</b>

11:45.757 --> 11:46.877
<b>[GINO] Hmm?</b>

11:49.837 --> 11:51.217
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

11:57.807 --> 12:01.357
<b>How did the Sword God
perform that slash?</b>

12:04.267 --> 12:05.567
<b>[GINO] Hm?</b>

12:08.197 --> 12:09.277
<b>[ERIS] Fingertips.</b>

12:10.617 --> 12:11.907
<b>Shoulder.</b>

12:16.617 --> 12:18.247
<b>That's not right.</b>

12:19.577 --> 12:21.207
<b>[sword saint gasps]</b>

12:22.747 --> 12:24.087
<b>[sword swooshes]</b>

12:32.597 --> 12:34.297
<b>[Eris pants]</b>

12:39.847 --> 12:41.647
<b>Gotta keep trying.</b>

12:42.057 --> 12:43.397
<b>♪</b>

13:21.387 --> 13:23.437
<b>[Eris pants]</b>

13:30.027 --> 13:31.447
<b>[Eris gasps]</b>

13:31.817 --> 13:34.237
<b>[grunts, yells]</b>

13:38.197 --> 13:40.117
<b>[panting]</b>

13:41.577 --> 13:43.207
<b>Not even close.</b>

13:56.217 --> 13:57.597
<b>[AUBER] Hello?</b>

13:58.177 --> 13:59.927
<b>-Anybody home?
-[footsteps]</b>

13:59.967 --> 14:01.427
<b>[AUBER] Hello!</b>

14:01.477 --> 14:02.637
<b>Huh?</b>

14:03.267 --> 14:06.397
<b>Oh! Good, I knew
someone had to be awake!</b>

14:06.807 --> 14:08.517
<b>I am the North Emperor,
Auber Corbe...</b>

14:08.567 --> 14:10.147
<b>-Out of my way.
-[gasps]</b>

14:11.987 --> 14:13.277
<b>[AUBER] What is she?</b>

14:13.317 --> 14:14.947
<b>[ERIS] I said move.</b>

14:15.567 --> 14:18.577
<b>Good lady, I am known
as Auber the Peacock Blade.</b>

14:18.617 --> 14:20.827
<b>Are you not a student
of the Sword God Style?</b>

14:21.367 --> 14:23.657
<b>If you would inform
the Sword God of my arrival, I--</b>

14:23.707 --> 14:25.997
<b>I'm not going to tell you again.</b>

14:43.057 --> 14:44.227
<b>[Eris exhales sharply]</b>

15:02.577 --> 15:05.207
<b>[Eris grunts, yells]</b>

15:08.837 --> 15:09.877
<b>[Auber gasps]</b>

15:14.797 --> 15:16.427
<b>[Eris pants]</b>

15:30.557 --> 15:32.267
<b>[GAL] That's enough.</b>

15:32.317 --> 15:33.477
<b>[AUBER] A-ha!</b>

15:34.147 --> 15:36.527
<b>It's been too long, Sword God.</b>

15:36.567 --> 15:37.947
<b>[thudding]</b>

15:37.987 --> 15:39.657
<b>[Eris panting]</b>

15:43.787 --> 15:45.787
<b>Indeed it has, North Emperor.</b>

15:46.287 --> 15:47.707
<b>I can't tell you
how delighted I was</b>

15:47.747 --> 15:49.497
<b>to receive your letter,
old friend.</b>

15:49.537 --> 15:51.207
<b>I had just arrived
at your training hall</b>

15:51.247 --> 15:52.957
<b>when this young lady...</b>

15:52.997 --> 15:56.217
<b>Never have I seen a child
so ferocious with a blade.</b>

15:56.257 --> 15:58.797
<b>She's practically
a wild animal... Ah!</b>

15:59.467 --> 16:01.927
<b>This must be the "Mad Dog"
you spoke of.</b>

16:02.347 --> 16:03.967
<b>[GAL] The very same.</b>

16:18.947 --> 16:20.867
<b>[footsteps]</b>

16:23.197 --> 16:24.827
<b>[door opens]</b>

16:25.867 --> 16:27.077
<b>[GHISLAINE] Welcome back.</b>

16:30.997 --> 16:32.337
<b>[objects clatter]</b>

16:32.627 --> 16:33.747
<b>[creaking]</b>

16:35.757 --> 16:37.047
<b>[Eris sighs]</b>

16:48.307 --> 16:49.557
<b>[Ghislaine grunts]</b>

16:49.807 --> 16:53.107
<b>Master, why do you refuse
to teach Eris?</b>

16:53.147 --> 16:54.767
<b>I've taught that girl plenty.</b>

16:54.817 --> 16:56.527
<b>Of practice swings?</b>

16:56.857 --> 16:59.437
<b>Come now.
I taught her how to train.</b>

16:59.487 --> 17:01.357
<b>What's the matter with you?</b>

17:01.397 --> 17:03.987
<b>I thought you valued
rationality above all.</b>

17:04.027 --> 17:05.077
<b>I sure do.</b>

17:05.117 --> 17:06.907
<b>Then what are you doing
with Eris?</b>

17:06.947 --> 17:08.497
<b>What's rational
about sending her out</b>

17:08.537 --> 17:10.077
<b>to do practice swings
every day,</b>

17:10.117 --> 17:11.787
<b>like that's all she understands?</b>

17:11.827 --> 17:13.577
<b>-Uh?
-It's been years,</b>

17:13.627 --> 17:16.127
<b>and she still can't perform
the Blade of Light.</b>

17:16.167 --> 17:18.297
<b>Why won't you get out there
and teach her?</b>

17:18.337 --> 17:20.507
<b>My, my!
When did you get to be</b>

17:20.547 --> 17:22.927
<b>such an insolent pain
in the ass, I wonder.</b>

17:22.967 --> 17:25.847
<b>Since way before
I came back here!</b>

17:27.807 --> 17:31.387
<b>So you finally think you know
better than your master, do you?</b>

17:31.427 --> 17:33.687
<b>No, I just... [grunts]</b>

17:33.727 --> 17:36.567
<b>You know, I hate to say it,</b>

17:36.607 --> 17:40.397
<b>but I have a few regrets about
where we left your education.</b>

17:40.437 --> 17:43.027
<b>You used to fight
like a starving tiger,</b>

17:43.067 --> 17:44.907
<b>and now you want to be
bottle fed</b>

17:44.947 --> 17:46.447
<b>like a toothless kitten.</b>

17:46.487 --> 17:48.287
<b>It really is a shame.</b>

17:48.327 --> 17:49.787
<b>The old Ghislaine
would have been</b>

17:49.827 --> 17:51.537
<b>a Sword Emperor by now.</b>

17:52.287 --> 17:53.457
<b>[Ghislaine exhales]</b>

17:56.587 --> 17:59.417
<b>Now go.
I'm done with pulling teeth.</b>

17:59.707 --> 18:00.877
<b>[Ghislaine sighs]</b>

18:00.917 --> 18:02.587
<b>We're not through!</b>

18:02.627 --> 18:04.637
<b>Tell me why you won't teach her!</b>

18:04.677 --> 18:06.887
<b>Seeing her like this
is just pathetic!</b>

18:06.927 --> 18:08.097
<b>[Gal sighs]</b>

18:09.177 --> 18:10.847
<b>You need me to spell it out?</b>

18:10.887 --> 18:12.387
<b>If you want to surpass me,</b>

18:12.427 --> 18:15.307
<b>keep being rational
and just maybe you'll get there.</b>

18:15.347 --> 18:17.767
<b>But that isn't good enough
for Eris.</b>

18:17.897 --> 18:19.777
<b>She's set her sights on Orsted.</b>

18:20.817 --> 18:23.857
<b>And the Dragon God
is a beast beyond reason.</b>

18:24.527 --> 18:27.907
<b>So no matter what I teach her,
it will never be enough.</b>

18:30.657 --> 18:32.197
<b>[sighs]</b>

18:33.157 --> 18:34.537
<b>All right, come here.</b>

18:34.577 --> 18:36.827
<b>I can "teach" her
all day long, sure.</b>

18:36.877 --> 18:38.417
<b>But Eris has a goal in mind</b>

18:38.457 --> 18:41.627
<b>where following instruction
will hinder that more than help.</b>

18:41.667 --> 18:42.917
<b>And so...</b>

18:43.087 --> 18:45.837
<b>Why is it you must always
speak in riddles, Master?</b>

18:45.887 --> 18:47.887
<b>I don't understand
what you mean.</b>

18:47.927 --> 18:49.097
<b>[Gal chuckles]</b>

18:49.137 --> 18:50.677
<b>I'm not trying to confuse you,</b>

18:50.717 --> 18:53.887
<b>but she's going to need more
than lessons from me alone.</b>

18:54.477 --> 18:56.387
<b>He will make a good start.</b>

18:56.807 --> 19:00.317
<b>North Emperor Auber Corbett
at your service, my lady.</b>

19:00.357 --> 19:02.567
<b>I am known to some
as the Peacock Blade.</b>

19:02.607 --> 19:03.937
<b>[Ghislaine sniffs]</b>

19:03.987 --> 19:05.987
<b>What does your discipline
want with us?</b>

19:06.027 --> 19:08.777
<b>Fear not, the Sword God
invited me.</b>

19:08.827 --> 19:11.947
<b>He bade me instruct
one of his "problem" students.</b>

19:11.987 --> 19:14.957
<b>The North God Style for Eris?
This won't suit her at all,</b>

19:14.997 --> 19:17.417
<b>she's too noble a fighter
for their filthy tricks.</b>

19:17.997 --> 19:19.877
<b>The Dragon God
will use them on her.</b>

19:19.917 --> 19:21.207
<b>[Ghislaine gasps]</b>

19:21.917 --> 19:24.377
<b>Who exactly is this Dragon God?</b>

19:24.417 --> 19:25.627
<b>Beats me.</b>

19:25.667 --> 19:26.837
<b>But they say</b>

19:26.877 --> 19:29.007
<b>he's a master of the Sword God,
North God,</b>

19:29.047 --> 19:30.547
<b>and Water God Styles all,</b>

19:30.597 --> 19:32.677
<b>and even that's irrespective
of his prowess</b>

19:32.717 --> 19:34.427
<b>as a God-ranked magician.</b>

19:34.467 --> 19:36.057
<b>He'll counter
any move she tries,</b>

19:36.097 --> 19:38.347
<b>and he's not above
a dirty trick or two.</b>

19:39.057 --> 19:40.857
<b>So, unless she learns them too,</b>

19:40.897 --> 19:42.977
<b>she'll never stand
on even footing.</b>

19:43.607 --> 19:44.687
<b>I see.</b>

19:45.277 --> 19:47.487
<b>You'll need a master
of the Water God Style as well.</b>

19:47.527 --> 19:50.317
<b>Oh, yes.
I've already sent the letter.</b>

19:50.867 --> 19:52.277
<b>[GHISLAINE] Have you?</b>

19:52.447 --> 19:53.827
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:54.737 --> 19:56.247
<b>I bid you welcome.</b>

19:56.287 --> 19:58.167
<b>Make yourself at home,
North Emperor.</b>

19:58.207 --> 20:00.877
<b>I will, much obliged.</b>

20:00.917 --> 20:02.837
<b>Thank you, Sword King.</b>

20:02.877 --> 20:04.247
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

20:05.797 --> 20:08.337
<b>[AUBER] Your savage welcome
the other morning</b>

20:08.377 --> 20:09.887
<b>gave me quite a thrill!</b>

20:10.587 --> 20:13.387
<b>So indulge me, please,</b>

20:13.427 --> 20:15.517
<b>and bare those fangs for me
once again!</b>

20:16.017 --> 20:17.177
<b>[Eris grunts]</b>

20:17.847 --> 20:18.977
<b>Begin!</b>

20:20.097 --> 20:21.307
<b>[Eris grunting]</b>

20:22.357 --> 20:23.477
<b>[Eris gasps]</b>

20:28.817 --> 20:29.857
<b>[Auber grunts]</b>

20:30.947 --> 20:32.987
<b>[Eris grunting]</b>

20:36.787 --> 20:37.907
<b>[Eris screams]</b>

20:38.577 --> 20:39.657
<b>[Eris grunts]</b>

20:39.707 --> 20:41.667
<b>[coughs]</b>

20:42.747 --> 20:44.457
<b>[Eris pants]</b>

20:44.997 --> 20:46.247
<b>[ERIS] I...</b>

20:46.587 --> 20:48.417
<b>I need to get stronger.</b>

20:48.457 --> 20:50.757
<b>Strong enough to stand
shoulder to shoulder</b>

20:50.797 --> 20:51.757
<b>with Rudeus.</b>

20:51.797 --> 20:53.757
<b>And who is "Rudeus"?</b>

20:53.797 --> 20:56.097
<b>[ERIS] I'm the sword fighter.</b>

20:56.387 --> 20:58.557
<b>And Rudeus is the mage.</b>

20:59.307 --> 21:00.387
<b>[Auber gasps]</b>

21:01.347 --> 21:03.267
<b>[ERIS] Rudeus is...</b>

21:06.607 --> 21:08.897
<b>Rudeus is amazing!</b>

21:26.497 --> 21:27.837
<b>[Ghislaine gasps]</b>

21:27.877 --> 21:29.127
<b>[chuckles]</b>

21:29.167 --> 21:31.167
<b>[SWORD SAINT 1]
Whoa, did you see that?</b>

21:31.217 --> 21:32.677
<b>[SWORD SAINT 2]
That speed, that power!</b>

21:32.717 --> 21:35.927
<b>Well, well.
A flawless Blade of Light.</b>

21:36.257 --> 21:37.847
<b>Incredible.</b>

21:39.517 --> 21:40.767
<b>[Gal chuckles softly]</b>

21:40.807 --> 21:42.137
<b>[Eris chuckles]</b>

21:43.147 --> 21:44.267
<b>Hm.</b>

21:45.017 --> 21:47.017
<b>[AUBER]
Yes, with all due acclaim!</b>

21:47.067 --> 21:49.227
<b>A hit, a palpable hit indeed!</b>

21:49.527 --> 21:51.437
<b>What say you, Mad Dog?</b>

21:51.947 --> 21:53.357
<b>Feel up to another round?</b>

21:53.397 --> 21:54.617
<b>[ERIS] Uh?</b>

21:55.117 --> 21:57.157
<b>[chuckles] I've got all day!</b>

21:57.867 --> 21:59.867
<b>-[Eris yells]
-[sticks clacking]</b>

22:04.827 --> 22:07.377
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>
